window.products.push({"id":1124232,"name":"AMTAST 2 in 1 Instant Read Thermometer Non-contact Infrared Thermometer Food Temperature Meter with HACCP Check for Cooking Grilling BBQ Lab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RnulVB4AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 2 in 1 thermometer is suitable for measuring food temperature in processing, preparation and brewing. Both the surface and internal temperature of the food can be accurately determined by using infrared scan function or thermocouple probe. Comes with a storage case for easily carrying and well protection. 1. Infrared Temperature Range -67 to 572°F(-55 to 250°C) 2. Infrared Accuracy for HACCP ± 1.8°F from32 to 149°F; otherwise ±1.5% of reading 3. Probe Temperature Range -67 to 626°F(-55 to 330°C) 4. Probe Accuracy ±0.9°F (0.5°C) 5. 0.1° resolution for accurate readings 6. Takes Fahrenheit or Celsius temperature readings 7. 2.5:1 Distance-to-spot size ratio 8. Easily adjust emissivity from 0.10 to1.00 in 0.01 steps (factory preset to 0.95) 9. IR and Probe measurement modes feature Minimum, Maximum, and \"Lock\" for continuous temperature scanning 10. One Lithium battery provides 40 hours of continuous operation in IR mode and 100 hours in probe mode Please Note: Batteries are not included in the package due to Aviation Security Check. Sorry for any inconvenience caused. Features: 1. Zone Display: Clearly indicate the Food is under a dangerous (4~60°C /40~140°F) or safe zone 2. 2 in1 design: Infrared + Foldable Thermocouple Probe 3. IP65 Protection 4. Bright White LED as pointer 5. Ultra Thin Design, fit into shirt pocket 6. National Lab Standard Traceable 7. IR-SoC technology (Infrared System on Chip) and Batch Calibration technology drive the dimensions and cost to the lowest limits 8. Max; Min and Lock modes 9. Retractable probe 10. Dual Display 11. Auto Power Off","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RnulVB4AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMTAST","source_asin":"B085KYGZGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085KYGZGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085KYGZGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
