window.products.push({"id":1124322,"name":"FUNLAX Wire Cube Storage Organizer, 9 Cube Metal Closet Organizers and Storage Modular Storage Cubes Shelves Portable Bookshelf Stackable Clothes Orga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZxAc-YjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Storage Space】The wire cube storage organizer is consists of 9 cubes.Each cube measures 12\"*12\"*12\"(30cm*30cm*30cm). Each of them can hold up to 22lbs (10kg), equates to 20 pack of 16.9 Fl Oz bottled water, which is enough for daily lightweight storage need. Puting heavier things on the bottom while light ones on the top will make the cube organizer shelf more stable. 【Sturdy and Durable】The panels of the cubbies made of powder-coated steel wire provides strong weight loading. The ABS connectors are seamlessly connected to the iron mesh panels to secure the whole structure firmly. Secure the corners and edges with the zip ties to double fasten the wire shelves. The cube shelf won't fall apart and you can move it after assemble with such a great stability. 【Easy to assemble】Simple module structure makes it easy to assemble. Simply insert the metal panels into the connector and make sure all the circular surface toward outside, keep the panels balance when you're putting them together, pay attention to the sound \"click\" which means all the corners are snapped in correctly. Fasten the edges and corners with zip ties after your assemble. Then you will get a firm cube storage organizer. 【Creative & Customizable Cube Organizer】The modular and interlocking design of the cube organizer allows multiple stacking option. The storage units can be changed in different configurations according to your space and taste. You can also design the internal layout for larger inner space. The utility and creativity of FUNLAX colset storage make it more than great storage solution but good decor for room, adding a Minimalistic aesthetic. 【Versatile for All Space Storage】These wire storage cubes help to keep you room tidy and clean. The 9 cube shelves can be used as closet organizer, cubby shelf, night stand, end table, storage shelf for clothes,books,toys, shoes, plushie collection, figure display, purses, linen,plants and other necessities. It's ideal for bedroom, living room, bathroom, office, gaming room, kids room, dorm or any place with limited amount of space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZxAc-YjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUNLAX","source_asin":"B0BQBY7L5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQBY7L5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQBY7L5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
