window.products.push({"id":1124372,"name":"Durgol Swiss Espresso, Descaler and Decalcifier for All Brands of Espresso Machines and Coffee Makers, 4.2 Fluid Ounces (Pack of 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815WZG6ptJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESCALING SOLUTION: Includes four 4.2 ounce bottles; this professional grade Durgol Swiss Espresso descaler will remove limescale and calcium buildup. Durgol products descale faster and more efficiently than home remedies, such as citrus and vinegar solutions. LIMESCALE REMOVER: Use Durgol Swiss Espresso to remove limescale on all types of coffee makers and espresso machines. Limescale reduces the brewing temperature, preventing the optimum release of aromas from the coffee beans. This has an adverse effect on the flavor of the coffee. MULTIPLE USES: Durgol Swiss Espresso descaling solution works on fully automatic coffee machines, capsule machines, pod machines and espresso machines. This includes Keurig, Nespresso, Braun, Breville, Jura Capresso, Delonghi, Cuisinart, Tassimo, Krups and Saeco FREQUENCY: Use 1 bottle of descaler each time descaling the machine. The frequency at which a coffee machine requires descaling and cleaning depends on how often it is used. Durgol recommends descaling every three months or after approx. 300 uses. MADE IN EUROPE: Durgol-the Swiss original against limescale. Durgol has been the \"Original Swiss Descaler\" since 1951. All products are developed and produced in Switzerland. Durgol products constantly undergo testing and further development.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815WZG6ptJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Durgol","source_asin":"B0777LFFG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0777LFFG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0777LFFG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
