window.products.push({"id":1124420,"name":"MadeTerra Mother of Pearl Drum End Table | Mossaic Kitchen & Vanity Stool - Midcentury Modern Coffee Side Table- Pearl Black Nightstand Drum End Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O4E4yfyeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝐒𝐓𝐘𝐋𝐈𝐒𝐇 𝐒𝐈𝐃𝐄 𝐓𝐀𝐁𝐋𝐄- This accent table at will make itself at home as a coffee table, bedside table or a nightstand. Featuring a mosaic design with coastal materials, this elegant drum-shaped table adds an instant touch of luxury to your living space. Thanks to the beautiful color and shiny finish, the nacre table is easy to decor with. It fits various rooms and designs, serving multiple purposes 𝐒𝐓𝐑𝐎𝐍𝐆 & 𝐂𝐋𝐀𝐒𝐒𝐘 𝐒𝐓𝐎𝐎𝐋- With its wood core, this item is strong and capable of witstanding high weight. Its standard height also allow it to be used not only as a table but also a unique coffee table or vanity stool. The flat bottom and well-built body makes it strong and sit steadily on the surface. It can also be charming as a stand for planter pot or night lamps. 𝐒𝐓𝐔𝐑𝐃𝐘 & 𝐃𝐔𝐑𝐀𝐁𝐋𝐄- Our nacre end table is made of sturdy acacia wood, inlayed with genuine mother of pearl, which stays as shiny and charming as new after a long time in use. The drum-shaped table stool is strong and could bear high weight. 𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐏𝐔𝐑𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐒𝐄 𝐌𝐀𝐊𝐄𝐒 𝐀𝐍 𝐈𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐂𝐓 - MadeTerra is a local maker-to-market company by artisans in Vietnam. This Capiz Shell End Table, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Boi Khe, the homeland of nacre inlaying art in Vietnam. With every purchase you make, you are making a difference, contributing to global fair trade, supporting artisan communities and preserving the indigenous crafts and cultures. KINDLY NOTE: In case you have any concerns with the purchased item or the product has any defects, PLEASE do not hesitate to request replacement items, a perfect alternation will be promptly sent to you with no additional fee. No return is required for the original ones. Our customer service is always ready to co-operate. Your satisfaction is our top priority!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O4E4yfyeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B09MKCSXP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MKCSXP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MKCSXP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
