window.products.push({"id":1124610,"name":"Pasta Drying Rack, Plastic Collapsible, 10 Folding Bar Arms, White with Spaghetti Measure Tool and Set of 3 Dry Pasta Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TueF6uGBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Save money and control what ingredients are used by making homemade pasta Make fresh pasta with only the best ingredients. By making homemade pasta, you have full control over what ingredients are included or left out which is great for allergies or food sensitivities. Making pasta at home is also a great family activity. You can make larger batches with this 10-armed pasta drying rack--saving you time and money. Aany extra pasta can be stored for another time with the included dry pasta bags. Or can be gifted to friends or family. Sturdy base with lots of space to dry No hunting for missing pieces like with other drying racks. The drying rack’s arms and legs remain together. The 4 legs that make up the base of the rack are built with a widened foot to provide stability and support. 10 arms extend and secure into place, allowing for up to 1 pound of pasta each. Easy to clean and compact to store Smooth plastic material makes for quick, easy, and sanitary clean up. Cleaning this pasta drying rack is incredibly simple. The mess wipes off with a soapy washcloth or sponge with water up to 140 degrees Fahrenheit (60 degrees Celsius). Once clean, the rack’s arms and legs can be easily collapsed down into its compact position and stored away discreetly in a kitchen drawer or cabinet. Complete with spaghetti measure tool and dry pasta bags Have a habit of making too much pasta at once? Keeping an eye on your portion sizes? Included in each package is a spaghetti measure tool and 3 dry pasta storage bags. Spaghetti measure tool can be used for homemade or store-bought pasta. Portion sizes for 1, 2, 3, and 4 people. If serving pasta for more than 4 people, just add the appropriate number of portions to match the number of guests you are serving. Kraft dry pasta bags can be used to store extra pasta for another time or to give as a gift to friends or family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TueF6uGBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pasta Drying Rack","source_asin":"B088YMRXPF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088YMRXPF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088YMRXPF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
