window.products.push({"id":1124660,"name":"CCyanzi Round Silicone Food Storage Containers with Lids Collapsible Food Containers Collapsible Silicone Bowls Lunch Boxes, for Kitchen and Camping, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yKNcxNN6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choosing Silicone Bowls? 1: Thousands of ocean creatures are killed by plastic products, which can not be recycled. Plastic waste has made a threat to the sustainable environment for hunman being. As a tiny individual, we need to sdopt some measures to change the worsening environment. Using reusable silicone bowls, refuse to use disposable plastic kitchen utensils will be our first step! 2: The steel food containers will rust; the glass food containers will be easily broken; the disposable food containers will release some toxic substance and pollute the enviroment. However, the silicone food container is environmental, unbreakable, safe to food. Why CCyanzi Brand Silicone Camping Bowls Set Better? 1:Larger Four Sizes : 1200ml/41oz; 800ml/27oz; 500ml/17oz; 350ml/12oz. Enough capacity packing small items like sandwiches, or expanded for packing salads and larger items. 2: Space Saving: Collapsible design will make your RV and hiking camping trip more easily. Simplify your life using collapsible storage that stacks neatly and saves you tons of space. 3: Leak Proof and With snap on clear locking lids: The airtight plastic lids will keep food fresh. 4: With silicone air vent:  Microwave, Freezer Safe. Package Include: Set of 4, Silicone Travel Camping Bowls Notes: * Clean them before the first time using. * Please use cautiously when Filled with hot liquid shaking. After-sale Service Policy : Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions, we will provide: 1: 15 Days Return Policy (Please keep the original packging bag in good condition) 2: 60 Days Warranty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yKNcxNN6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CCyanzi","source_asin":"B08JVDMQ1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JVDMQ1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JVDMQ1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
