window.products.push({"id":1124681,"name":"Sondiko Culinary Butane Torch, Black and Gray SP400, Fit All Small Butane Tanks with Safety Lock and Adjustable Flame for Desserts, Creme Brulee(Butan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718w9rnPnLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fit ALL Butane Small Tanks - Are you still worried about not knowing which tank type to choose? Don’t worry, Sondiko kitchen blow torch fits any brand of small butane gas with whether long nozzle or short nozzle! This torch can be directly inflated for the long nozzle gas tank. For gas tank with short nozzle, add the red adapter included in the box to lengthen the nozzle, then refill the torch. Safe&Durable - With safety lock prevents accidental ignition and a wide set base helps to prevent it falling over. Long angled nozzle and burn-free finger guard keep your hand safely away from the flame. Made with durable Aluminum alloy body for long lasting use. Refillable&Easy to Operate - Refill the kitchen torch with any brand of butane(Butane Gas Isn't Included), simply slide the security lock to open, light up with Piezo Ignition Technology. It is a portable&mini torch that you can take it for many outdoor activities like camping and BBQ. Great Gift&Versatile - Ideal for caramelizing sugar atop creme brulee, glazing a baked ham, searing a steak, roasting bell peppers, melting cheese and toasting bread crumbs. Also useful for lighting your fireplace, candles, for hobby, arts and crafts projects, jewelry making, welding, for multiple camping applications, dabs, and much more. Adjustable Flame&Continuously Flame Mode - Piezo Ignition Technology allows for using at any angle even upside down with effortless one hand operation, adjustable temperature regulator for complete control of flame and allows flame temperature to reach up to 1300 °C/2372 °F. Press the button to light fire, turn the safety lock clockwise at the same time, then it will keep firing without your pressing. Baking, cooking is much easier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718w9rnPnLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sondiko","source_asin":"B09B37VFSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B37VFSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B37VFSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
