window.products.push({"id":1124805,"name":"Oyydecor Christmas Stocking Holders for Mantle Set of 4, Non-Slip Adjustable Stocking Hangers Ornament Hooks Fireplace Metal Clips for Christmas Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QrpOPdXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality material: Made of high quality light weight cast iron metal with plating treatment, which is rustproof and corrosion resistant. We use quality raw materials, so if you have children or pets at home, you don't have to worry about allergies. Adjustable and easy to use: The mantel stocking hangers can adjust from 0.5\" to 3\" which allows it to fit almost any size or shape of a mantel and Fireplace. The thickness of the stocking holder is 0.11\", the length of the Metal Clip for Christmas stocking is 4.5\", width is 0.5\", weight: only 0.11 lbs. Not only fits square edge of Fireplace, but also works really well for sloped, shallow and complex edges of mantel. Strong adhesion: Each package has 6 high-quality removable transparent double-sided tape, which is safe and non-toxic. You can cut a short piece of double-sided tape and attach it to the hook to hold the fireplace tight and protect the mantel surface. It won't damage the fireplace if you take the hooks off, and there won't be any glue left on the countertop when you remove them. The hooks can hold up to 10lbs. Friendly stocking holder for kids & pets: The lightweight design makes it’s a sensible option for homes with curious children or pets. Compared to heavy, counter-balance stocking holders for Fireplace, this simple Christmas stocking holder is a wise choice. Great to add some festive atmosphere at home, also for Christmas party decorations. Good as a gift to your family and friends. Widely-used christmas stocking holder： The adjustable metal hook is a useful tool for hanging Christmas stockings or other decorations, such as wreaths and mantelpiece lights. It is also a perfect choice as a Christmas stocking hook and is the perfect Christmas ornament to enhance the Christmas atmosphere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QrpOPdXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oyydecor","source_asin":"B09LH18Q9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LH18Q9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LH18Q9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
