window.products.push({"id":1124927,"name":"Culina Premium Potato Ricer and Baby Food Strainer, BPA-Free 2 Stainless Steel Blades","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MQ-nbNASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you wish for an efficient way to start a healthy diet and eat more veggies? Are you looking to feed baby your own homemade puree full of nutrients and love? Time to regain control over meal served at the family dinner table (or baby's high chair) time to equip your kitchen with Culina Potato Ricer. Ditch preservatives and the countless other harmful chemicals for good. Culina Potato Ricer is so easy and quick and efficient to use, you'll wonder what took you so long to get started! Utilitarian, daily use and great performance every time Constructed with a fortified plastic material, our ricer boasts a 3.25\"x3\" hopper area large enough to accommodate cooking for a large party in one sitting. Extra perforations of the ricing dish make for smooth, fluffy mashed vegetables. No lumps, no mess; the mashed food travels through blades' spuds directly. No clumping food back inside or splattering all over the kitchen as most contraptions would! Culina Potato ricer is engineered to elicit as little effort as possible from you and get the job done! Healthy, nutritious, homemade family dinner and baby food For your additional convenience, Culina Potato Ricer is designed with a smart front grip for stability and balance over pots and recipients. Vegetables and fruits are mashed in a quick, easy, ricing motion. Place the boiled vegetable or fruit in the hopper, press down, no extra force required, food is ready. Looking smooth, tasty, fluffy and full of nutrients, just as nature intended. Stay away from processed food, with Culina Potato Ricer, homemade baby food is a budget-friendly, healthy and flavorful experience! Your turn to try! Once you get equipped, don't just keep the secret to heavenly, tasty, riced food to yourself! Feel free to spread the joy and share the homemade experience with family and friends. Our line of kitchen essentials make for excellent gift ideas for any occasion!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MQ-nbNASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Culina","source_asin":"B00FL7095I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FL7095I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FL7095I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1124928,"name":"Catahoula Leopard Dog Clean Dirty Dishwasher Fridge Magnet No 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61it5IXZfLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fantastic large 3 1/2 x 2 1/2 inch (9cms x 6.5 cms) rectangular DISHWASHER MAGNETS. The item is printed to a very high quality gloss finish on a sturdy metal casing. The back of the item features a very strong full size magnet. Buy this magnet and prevent hubby, wife, son or daughter from putting those dirty dishes in with the clean ones. Simply rotate the magnet and everyone knows the Dishwasher status. Could not be simpler. These items are professionally factory manufactured and make ideal gift items for any lovers or collectors of items featuring this adorable breed. PLEASE ENSURE THAT YOUR DISHWASHER HAS A MAGNETIC FRONT AS OBVIOUSLY THIS FRIDGE MAGNET WILL NOT STICK TO A PLASTIC, ALUMINUM OR GLASS FACED DISHWASHER DOOR.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61it5IXZfLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wag Whimsy","source_asin":"B003VPYC6O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1124928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003VPYC6O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003VPYC6O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
